# What must never reach the build context.
#
# Two entries here are not housekeeping, and both are specific to this repo:
#
#   hr/          the virtualenv, 1.3 GB. The usual venv/ .venv/ env/ lines miss
#                it because this project's is named `hr/` (see CLAUDE.md). Left
#                out, every `docker build` uploads 1.3 GB to the daemon before
#                it runs a single instruction.
#
#   data/*.db    the audit log: every employee question and the answer they were
#                given. `/api/audit` is admin-gated precisely because those rows
#                are HR-sensitive, so baking one into a distributable image
#                would hand out the thing the endpoint exists to protect.
#
# Everything else is size and reproducibility.

# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Version control and CI --------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# --- Virtualenvs -------------------------------------------------------------
# `hr/` is this project's; the rest are the conventional names, kept so a
# checkout that made one under a different name is still covered.
hr/
venv
.venv
env
ENV

# --- Python bytecode and tooling caches --------------------------------------
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.pyd
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
*.egg-info
.coverage
htmlcov

# --- Editors and IDEs --------------------------------------------------------
.idea
.vscode
.cursor
.claude

# --- Tests and dev-only entry points -----------------------------------------
# The runtime image serves the app; the suite runs in CI against the source.
tests
create_project.py

# --- Local state -------------------------------------------------------------
# The audit database and anything an admin has already uploaded. Both are
# runtime state that belongs on a mounted volume, never in the image.
data/*.db
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
uploads/*
!uploads/.gitkeep
*.log

# --- Documentation -----------------------------------------------------------
# The reference brief and the architecture diagram are ~1.8 MB of PDF and PNG
# that nothing at runtime reads.
docs
*.md
!README.md

# --- OS noise ----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
